          "status": "generated",
          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p><b>Katherine Johnson</b>, 52-year-old female (DOB 1974-03-15). Invasive ductal carcinoma of the right breast, Stage IIA (T2 N0 M0), diagnosed January 2026. ER+, PR-, HER2- (IHC 1+). Post-menopausal. Oncotype DX recurrence score 28. ECOG Performance Status 0. Surgery (lumpectomy + sentinel lymph node biopsy) completed; no prior systemic therapy.</p><p><b>Clinical scenario (CodeX PA in MedOnc POC base case):</b> Adjuvant systemic therapy selection after surgery. Oncotype DX score 28 supports adjuvant chemotherapy. Proposed regimen: dose-dense AC/T with pegfilgrastim (Neulasta) support. Payer step-therapy policy requires pegfilgrastim-cbqv (Udenyca) unless exception criteria are met.</p></div>"
